---
/**
 * The site's cascade layer order (docs/plans/2026-10-20-css-cascade-layers.md).
 * A browser fixes the order at the first mention of each layer, so this has to
 * be the first style on the page, before any stylesheet that uses a layer.
 * Render it first in <head> on every document that does not use Layout.
 */
---
<style is:inline>@layer kit, base, composition, utilities, blocks, exceptions, legacy;</style>
